            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-02T20:25:31.869281+00:00",
            "notes": "\ud83d\udd0d Common Questions\n\n1. Why not pick \" [Scorched Earth](item_649ab2ad-f6c3-47e2-896b-23df8e0cb310) \" first?\n\nGreat question. In Round 1, you're still in the default phase of gameplay. You need a solid defensive base to withstand early pressure.\nWithout \" [Electro Lights](item_d4ac5963-81ea-41b8-bc26-71905fadf860) \" (which keeps your gun cooldown active), your main source of consistent value is surviving and getting gold.\n\" [Scorched Earth](item_649ab2ad-f6c3-47e2-896b-23df8e0cb310) \" shines later not at the beginning.\n\n2. Why skip the \" [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \"?\n\nBecause Orisa already has innate armor and \"Fortify\" gives you temporary \"Overhealth\", immune to CC \"Crowd Control\". So instead of stacking more passive durability, take \" [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \" Early.\nThis lets you rack up gold in Round 1 and start snowballing your power curve.\n\n3. Why choose \" [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) \" over \" [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \" (10% Ability Power)?\n\nWhen you're running \" [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \", you\u2019ll charge your \"Terra Surge\" (ultimate) quickly.\nI typically get two ultimates in Round 1.\n\" [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)\" gives you +25 Armor and +10% Ability Power after the first Terra Surge used, letting you do both: survive and burst.",
